Package: eloextend
Title: Extended Elo-like Ratings for Multiplayer Games
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("John", "Mulvey", , "mulveyjf@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extends the Elo rating system to multiplayer games with 3 or more players,
    providing tools for rating calculation, result prediction, and visualisation and
    analysis of ratings histories.
